// The Properties walkthroughs, as configuration.
//
// One entry per Help topic that has something to point at, keyed by the same
// id the topic has — so Help and the walkthroughs cannot drift apart, and
// adding a step is an edit here rather than a change to the overlay.
//
// Targets are `data-tutorial` names, never CSS classes. Classes in this CMS
// come from a template that is meant to be swapped; a walkthrough hung off one
// would break the first time somebody restyled a button.
//
// Not every Help topic appears here, and that is deliberate. "Why can I not
// open my new property" is a thing to understand, not a button to press, and
// a walkthrough that spotlights nothing would be worse than the paragraph.

