// The walkthroughs, as configuration.
//
// One entry per Help topic, keyed by the same id the topic already had — so
// the Help list and the walkthroughs cannot drift apart, and adding a step is
// an edit here rather than a change to the overlay.
//
// Targets are `data-tutorial` names. Nothing here knows what the overlay looks
// like, and the overlay knows nothing about applications.

